#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:1 fbba2ae065f044e59f3e3478865cb32e
msgid "Pagination"
msgstr "पेजिनेशन"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:3 5f7e67ee4bee43729224b7b6d69b3f63
msgid ""
"List endpoints are **keyset-paginated** for stable, efficient paging — "
"unlike offset paging, a row inserted while you iterate can't shift items "
"onto a page you already read."
msgstr ""
"लिस्ट एंडपॉइंट्स स्थिर, कुशल पेजिंग के लिए **कीसेट-पेजिनेटेड** हैं — "
"ऑफ़सेट पेजिंग के विपरीत, जब आप इटरेट कर रहे हों तब इंसर्ट की गई कोई रो "
"आइटम्स को उस पेज पर शिफ़्ट नहीं कर सकती जिसे आप पहले ही पढ़ चुके हैं।"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:5 e69abbe515fc469ead547ef212947594
msgid "Pass `?limit=` (1–50, default 20) to size a page."
msgstr "पेज का आकार तय करने के लिए `?limit=` (1–50, डिफ़ॉल्ट 20) पास करें।"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:6 ee384dc76e714ca7a2d6ea6f6e760855
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Each response is `{ \"data\": [...], \"nextCursor\": \"<opaque>\" | null "
"}`."
msgstr ""
"हर रिस्पॉन्स `{ \"data\": [...], \"nextCursor\": \"<opaque>\" | null }` "
"होता है।"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:7 2691830ab48c4cc8b414fde634dd6532
msgid "To fetch the next page, pass the returned `nextCursor` as `?cursor=`."
msgstr ""
"अगला पेज पाने के लिए, रिटर्न किए गए `nextCursor` को `?cursor=` के रूप में"
" पास करें।"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:8 ceff1879e8da4286995f484f63b3a192
msgid "`nextCursor` is `null` on the last page."
msgstr "आख़िरी पेज पर `nextCursor`, `null` होता है।"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:10 5f9b500f28374d6cb059bd6f4d4b2a8e
msgid ""
"# First page\n"
"curl \"https://rmhstudios.com/api/v1/feed?limit=20\" -H \"Authorization: "
"Bearer $RMH_KEY\"\n"
"\n"
"# Next page\n"
"curl "
"\"https://rmhstudios.com/api/v1/feed?limit=20&cursor=2026-06-20T09:59:00.000Z\""
" \\\n"
"  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $RMH_KEY\"\n"
msgstr ""
"# First page\n"
"curl \"https://rmhstudios.com/api/v1/feed?limit=20\" -H \"Authorization: "
"Bearer $RMH_KEY\"\n"
"\n"
"# Next page\n"
"curl "
"\"https://rmhstudios.com/api/v1/feed?limit=20&cursor=2026-06-20T09:59:00.000Z\""
" \\\n"
"  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $RMH_KEY\"\n"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:19 313bda275dc74ea38e00431c85c1b477
msgid ""
"Treat the cursor as opaque — it currently looks like a timestamp, but "
"that is an implementation detail and may change. Store it and send it "
"back verbatim; don't construct one."
msgstr ""
"कर्सर को ओपेक (अपारदर्शी) मानें — यह अभी टाइमस्टैंप जैसा दिखता है, लेकिन "
"यह एक इम्प्लीमेंटेशन डिटेल है और बदल सकता है। इसे स्टोर करें और ज्यों-का-"
"त्यों वापस भेजें; इसे खुद न बनाएँ।"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:21 12e071d8855848f782b8c87ee505aa9b
msgid "Iterating a full list"
msgstr "पूरी लिस्ट को इटरेट करना"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:23 155e192833f24011a8d79e0ee06ea67b
msgid ""
"async function* pages(path, key) {\n"
"  let cursor = null;\n"
"  do {\n"
"    const url = new URL(`https://rmhstudios.com${path}`);\n"
"    url.searchParams.set('limit', '50');\n"
"    if (cursor) url.searchParams.set('cursor', cursor);\n"
"    const res = await fetch(url, { headers: { Authorization: `Bearer "
"${key}` } });\n"
"    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`${res.status} ${(await "
"res.json()).error?.code}`);\n"
"    const body = await res.json();\n"
"    yield* body.data;\n"
"    cursor = body.nextCursor;\n"
"  } while (cursor);\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"async function* pages(path, key) {\n"
"  let cursor = null;\n"
"  do {\n"
"    const url = new URL(`https://rmhstudios.com${path}`);\n"
"    url.searchParams.set('limit', '50');\n"
"    if (cursor) url.searchParams.set('cursor', cursor);\n"
"    const res = await fetch(url, { headers: { Authorization: `Bearer "
"${key}` } });\n"
"    if (!res.ok) throw new Error(`${res.status} ${(await "
"res.json()).error?.code}`);\n"
"    const body = await res.json();\n"
"    yield* body.data;\n"
"    cursor = body.nextCursor;\n"
"  } while (cursor);\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../developer-api/pagination.md:39 95c15fa6f67143d49d1761a0e73da063
msgid ""
"Stop on `nextCursor === null` — not on an empty `data` array, which is "
"not a guaranteed terminator."
msgstr ""
"`nextCursor === null` पर रुकें — किसी खाली `data` ऐरे पर नहीं, जो एक "
"गारंटीड टर्मिनेटर नहीं है।"
